 Li-ion battery cell manufactured by LG CHEM.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 156.8px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 156.8px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 156.8px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15528121\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Anode GITT Features</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 156.8px;\">This record contains features observed in the GITT (without intermittent EIS) measurement on the harvested negative electrode (anode) of the INR18650-MJ1 cylindrical 18650 cell from LG CHEM. It also serves as input for EP-BOLFI parameterization.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15528169\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Anode GITT Parameter Collection</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\">This record contains workflows to collect the parameterizations on individual SOC points with EP-BOLFI of a GITT without intermittent EIS) measurement on the harvested negative electrode (anode) of an INR18650-MJ1 Li-ion cell from LG CHEM. The result is a reasonable fitting spline for each estimated parameter as a function of SOC.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#iscontinuedby\">IsContinuedBy</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15496570\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Lithium-Ion Battery Cell Complete Continuum Simulation Parameters</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\">This record contains a complete and PyBaMM-compatible parameter set for the INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 cell and incomplete versions of it that were used in an exempular GITT characterization workflow. Most parameters are repackaged laboratory measurement results and SOC alignment checks with a GITT (without intermittent EIS) measurement on the harvested electrodes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Licensing</h1>\n<p>This dataset is licensed under CC-BY 4.0, allowing for sharing and adaptation with proper attribution.</p>\n<h1>Contact Information</h1>\n<p>For questions or further assistance, please contact Dennis Kopljar at dennis.kopljar@dlr.de.</p>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<p>This dataset is linked to the following publication: [DOI/Link to publication].</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kuhn, Yannick", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-9019-2290"}, {"name": "Rana, Bhawna", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0001-6403-5139"}, {"name": "Philipp, Micha", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0009-0002-8705-2059"}, {"name": "Schmitt, Christina", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-4095-7611"}, {"name": "Scipioni, Roberto", "affiliation": "SINTEF Energy Research", "orcid": "0000-0003-1926-421X"}, {"name": "Flores, Eibar", "affiliation": "SINTEF Industry", "orcid": "0000-0003-2954-1233"}, {"name": "Kopljar, Dennis", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-2228-2016"}, {"name": "Clark, Simon", "affiliation": "SINTEF Industry", "orcid": "0000-0002-8758-6109"}, {"name": "Latz, Arnulf", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0003-1449-8172"}, {"name": "Horstmann, Birger", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-1500-0578"}], "keywords": ["graphite"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.6967238", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15528065", "relation": "isPartOf", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15528121", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"id